                <head>No. 478<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On Sunday, February 14, before the seventeenth plenary meeting (see Sectos 144 and 145, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >infra</hi> and <ref target="#d480">Document 480</ref>), Secretary Dulles held a press conference in Berlin to
                    respond to questions concerning the progress of the conference. The United
                    States Delegation transmitted the transcript of the press conference in Secto 148 from Berlin, February 15. (Conference
                    files, lot 60 D 627, CF 210)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
